Please read these Terms and Conditions ("Terms", "Terms and Conditions") carefully before using this website, the CaptureAge Classic desktop application for UserPatch ("CAC"), the CaptureAge for Definitive Edition desktop application ("CA:DE") or any other products or applications associated with our services (collectively, the "Service") operated by CaptureAge ("us", "we", or "our").

Some terms here are specific to the application you are using while others apply to both CAC and CA:DE. The word "Applications" is used to refer to CAC and CA:DE collectively where relevant.

Your agreement with us includes these Terms and our Privacy Policy (collectively, the “Agreements”).

By subscribing or otherwise using the Service you acknowledge that you have read and understood the Agreements, accept the Agreements and agree to be bound by them. If you don’t agree or cannot comply with the Agreements then you may not use the CaptureAge Service.

