In the case of material changes we will let you know via email and/or a prominent notice on our Service, prior to the change becoming effective and update the "effective date" at the top of these Terms.

Continued usage of the Service constitutes your acceptance of the changes. If you do not want to accept the new Agreements then you may terminate your account by contacting us.

Access to the Applications

Free usage of CA:DE is available to all owners of Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition. However, some features in CA:DE are only available to users with a Paid Subscription.

Paid Subscriptions

Paid Subscriptions may grant access to and permission to use additional features in the Applications that are not otherwise available. Different payment amounts may correspond to different sets of features, called a "Subscription Type", "Subscription Tier" or "Reward Level". Paid Subscriptions are specific to an application: a Paid Subscription to CAC does not change your access to features in CA:DE or vice versa.

When you sign up for a Paid Subscription you must provide us with information that is accurate and complete, and you must keep this information up to date. Failure to provide us with accurate and complete information may cause your account to become inaccessible, and for us to be unable to provide support or refunds of any fees paid.

If you purchase a Paid Subscription you may cancel this subscription at any time, for any or no reason, during the first 14 days after you first signed up for the service (the “Cooling-Off Period”) for a full refund of any fees paid to CaptureAge. Subsequent subscriptions will not be eligible for the Cooling-Off Period. To cancel a Paid Subscription and receive a refund during the Cooling-Off Period please contact us.

A Paid Subscription lasts for one calendar month, and will recur automatically. By entering into a Paid Subscription you authorise CaptureAge to charge you automatically each month until you cancel. You may cancel your Paid Subscription through the self-service options on your profile page or by contacting CaptureAge. Cancellations will take effect the day after the last day of the current subscription period, unless they are in the Cooling-Off Period, in which case they take effect as soon as they are processed.

You may change your Subscription Type at any time. If you upgrade your old Subscription Type to a new Subscription Type that has a higher fee than your current Subscription Type, then you will be charged a prorated fee to cover the remainder of your current billing period and your new Subscription Type will begin immediately. If the new Subscription Type has a lower fee than the current Subscription Type then your new Subscription Type will begin at the start of your next billing period.

CaptureAge will not refund any fees if you cancel or change your subscription at any time other than during the Cooling-Off Period.

We may change the price charged to qualify for different Subscription Types. Price changes will take effect from the beginning of the next subscription period following the date of the price change. We will notify you at least 30 days before increases to the price of your subscription and you may reject the change by cancelling your Subscription prior to the change taking effect.

